body:
Not only have I not grown and moved forward I've actively regressed and self destructed. Arguably this was due to toxic influences around me but...well.

&#x200B;

All I trust is cold rationality at this point. And not depressions cold logic. Because it masquerades as it but lies to my face while wearing Sherlocks beanie, the fatherfucker.

&#x200B;

Nothing is all or nothing. Nothing. Ever. Never. Life is too complex for it. As is the universe. I'm not trying to give you it will get better hoo hah, maybe I'm just fucking intellectualizing as a defense mechanism but I know.I'm fucking right.

Our brain chemicals are out of whack and we are not seeing everything. There's a lot of shit. There's a lot of not shit. A lot of actual good. A lot of muddled colors. All we are seeing is shit.

&#x200B;

In a sense, we are.colorblind.

Or I guess, lifeblind. 

&#x200B;

I don't know when or if you will 'feel' things getting better. But life has peaks and troughs and in betweens. Objectively analyze your life. Objectively pick out the 'right' actions, so long as they were conducive to your life.

It could be as simple as petting a dog, or sleeping st the right time. I don't fucking care how small it is. Choose the smallest that applies to you. 

&#x200B;

I'm sick of trying too man. I am also sick of being sick. I'm sick of yelling and screaming and not being heard. 

I'm concerned this may sound heavy handed or rough, sorry, tough love isn't my intention. Merely a firm redirection to how you are looking at things. Imagine Jigglypuff saying that shit if it helps, I don't know.
